"""The table of every setting: key, type, default, allowed values, meaning.

The one place settings are defined.  After a change run
``python -m pdukit.config.reference --write`` to refresh
``docs/OPTIONS.md`` and ``pdukit/params/default.ppf``.

One row per setting:

    (group, key, dest, kind, default, choices, nargs_list, run_specific, help)

``key`` is the name used in ``.ppf`` files and ``--set``; ``dest`` is the name
the pipeline reads (``cfg.dest`` or ``cfg["dest"]``).  ``kind`` is one of
``int``, ``float``, ``str``, ``flag`` (yes/no, true when set) and ``noflag``
(yes/no, false when set).
"""

